insert into shots (shot_id,clip_id,shot_index,tc_in,tc_out,duration_s,verbatim_text,description,subject_role,action,food_item,food_role,setting,camera_framing,camera_angle,camera_movement,motion_speed,lighting,vfx,mood) values ('APX-S-4306-1','APX-C-4306',1,0,2,2,'A breathtaking ancient forest transformed into a cathedral of light and nature. Towering oak trees draped in cascading white silk ribbons, their branches intertwined overhead forming a living canopy. Thousands of ivory candles line a petal-strewn aisle, flames perfectly still despite the open air, casting a warm trembling gold across everything they touch. Thousands of flowers — white roses, baby''s breath, wisteria, cherry blossoms — float impossibly in the air at every height, slowly rotating, petals drifting downward like the gentlest snowfall ever witnessed. A hush falls over the gathered crowd seated on either side, their faces bathed in flickering candlelight. Then she appears. A bride at the far end of the aisle, silhouetted in soft ethereal backlight, her cathedral veil catching every floating petal that grazes it. She moves slowly, deliberately, radiantly — each step releasing a subtle ripple of light through the candles on either side. Close up on her face — eyes glistening, lips softly parted, a single tear escaping down a perfectly powdered cheek. The floating flowers part gently as she passes, as though the forest itself is making way for her. Camera glides alongside her in a smooth cinematic tracking shot — candle flames bowing slightly as she passes as if in reverence. The crowd dissolves into silence and tears. Wide shot from above — the full breathtaking aisle of light and floating blooms — the bride a single luminous figure moving through a dream made real. Cinematic. Ethereal. Heartbreakingly beautiful.
